    "title": "'A sight I couldn't believe:' Gotha family's doorbell camera captures late-night visit from bear - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago GOTHA, Fla. – It was an unwelcome guest late at night when a family in Gotha encountered a bear on their front porch. The moment was captured on their doorbell camera. Julissa Pena says she couldn’t believe it when her son, who was sitting in the car in their driveway, called to tell them not to open the door because a bear was approaching the house. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
